    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert Operations Analyst.\n\nAnalyze the operational data received from Google Sheets. \nGenerate a professional weekly operations report based on this data.\n\nData:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.report_data) }}\n\nIMPORTANT INSTRUCTIONS:\nYou must output your response as a raw JSON object with this exact structure:\n\n{\n  \"content\": \"The full weekly operations report formatted cleanly in Markdown. Include headings for KPI Summary, Top Performers, Trends and Insights, Risks, and Recommendations.\",\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"report_health\": \"Good, Warning, or Critical based on your analysis\",\n    \"key_metrics_extracted\": [\"metric1\", \"metric2\", \"metric3\"],\n    \"risk_factors\": [\"risk1\", \"risk2\"]\n  }\n}\n\nCRITICAL: Return ONLY the raw JSON object. Do not wrap your response in markdown code blocks (do NOT use ```json). Do not include any introductory text like \"Here is the report\" or any concluding text. Start your response immediately with the { character and end with the } character.",
        "batching": {}
      },
